<%# CCN fork — Stage 4, US2 (specs/003-p1-features): the account's logo above the text of every e-mail the
    instance sends. Absolute URL (an inbox has no session and no relative base) and nothing at all when the
    instance does not know its own URL — a missing logo, never a broken image. The "Sent using DocuSeal"
    attribution below (shared/_email_attribution) is never touched. %>
<% if @current_account&.logo&.attached? && Ccn::AccountLogo.email_host_configured? %>
  <p>
    <%= image_tag ActiveStorage::Blob.proxy_url(@current_account.logo.blob), alt: @current_account.name, height: 48, style: 'max-height: 48px; width: auto;' %>
  </p>
<% end %>
